Consider this snippet tracking warehouse shipments. What integer value is emitted when executed?

```java
class CargoManifest {
    static int cumulativeWeight = 50;
    CargoManifest(int addedWeight) {
        cumulativeWeight += addedWeight;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        CargoManifest shipmentOne = new CargoManifest(20);
        CargoManifest shipmentTwo = new CargoManifest(40);
        System.out.println(CargoManifest.cumulativeWeight);
    }
}
```

