What is the output of the following Java program?

```java
class Tracker {
    static int total = 5;
    static {
        total += 10;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.print(Tracker.total + " ");
        Tracker t = new Tracker();
        t.total += 2;
        System.out.println(Tracker.total);
    }
}
```

