What is printed by the following program?

```java
class BaseNode {
    static int tag = 1;
}
class SubNode extends BaseNode {
    static int tag = 2;
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BaseNode node = new SubNode();
        System.out.print(node.tag + " ");
        System.out.print(SubNode.tag + " ");
        System.out.println(((BaseNode)new SubNode()).tag);
    }
}
```
